      "text": "The ADU is three rectangles built from the owner's floor and roof plans: a rear wing (grids 01 to 03), and a front great room (grids 02 to 04), with an open yard notch to the southwest and an open courtyard to the northeast. Wall faces sit 2 7/8 in outside the grid (8'-11 1/2\" on the west). The footprint is about 566 sq ft; the printed 616 sq ft also counts the 12'-2 3/4\" by 4'-0\" entry landing.",
